        "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cleanse worlds. Survive the swarm. Upgrade your mech.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mecha Survivors is a <strong>Survivors-like</strong> action roguelite where you take control of an advanced combat mech sent to purge hostile planets overrun by alien machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dropped into endless warzones, you must face overwhelming waves of enemies, collect powerful upgrades, and adapt your build in real time. Choose from multiple mech classes, each with unique abilities and playstyles, and fight for survival on a planetary scale.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planetary purge missions: Deploy into procedurally generated battlefields to cleanse entire regions of enemy forces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down mech combat: Pilot heavy war machines in fast-paced, bullet-dodging action against massive enemy swarms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic roguelite progression: Combine randomized skills and passive upgrades to create devastating builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple mech classes: Unlock and master unique mechs with specialized skills and ultimate abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized sci-fi visuals: Vibrant low-poly environments filled with chaos, explosions, and reactive effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayable survival challenges: Every run is different. How long can you hold the line?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Survive. Adapt. Cleanse.</p>",
        "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Cleanse worlds. Survive the swarm. Upgrade your mech.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mecha Survivors is a <strong>Survivors-like</strong> action roguelite where you take control of an advanced combat mech sent to purge hostile planets overrun by alien machines.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dropped into endless warzones, you must face overwhelming waves of enemies, collect powerful upgrades, and adapt your build in real time. Choose from multiple mech classes, each with unique abilities and playstyles, and fight for survival on a planetary scale.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Key Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Planetary purge missions: Deploy into procedurally generated battlefields to cleanse entire regions of enemy forces.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Top-down mech combat: Pilot heavy war machines in fast-paced, bullet-dodging action against massive enemy swarms.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dynamic roguelite progression: Combine randomized skills and passive upgrades to create devastating builds.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Multiple mech classes: Unlock and master unique mechs with specialized skills and ultimate abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stylized sci-fi visuals: Vibrant low-poly environments filled with chaos, explosions, and reactive effects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Replayable survival challenges: Every run is different. How long can you hold the line?</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Survive. Adapt. Cleanse.</p>",
